WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.371
A frequency table counts observations in categories. Add the category frequencies to

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:06.664
verify the total.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:13.427
Which is the highest frequency in [3, 5, 3, 4]? The answer is 5. The maximum entry in

00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:15.064
the frequency table is 5.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:21.102
A survey in the class garden records four groups with frequencies [10, 6, 5, 4].

00:00:21.102 --> 00:00:24.592
Which is the total frequency? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:31.055
A survey in the class garden records four groups with frequencies [10, 6, 5, 4].

00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:37.034
Which is the total frequency? The answer is 25. Add all four values to obtain 25.
